     \"区分提交、成功确认与未知结果，并指出确认所需的两项依据。\"\n+    ],\n+    \"activities\": [\n+      {\n+        \"id\": \"permission-check\",\n+        \"correctIndex\": 1,\n+        \"reference\": \"本次不允许。LIB2 要求尚未逾期且没有其他读者预约，两项条件同时成立才规则允许；规则允许仍不等于已成功。\"\n+      },\n+      {\n+        \"id\": \"date-check\",\n+        \"correctIndex\": 0,\n+        \"reference\": \"成功：2026-11-05；失败：2026-10-29。日期基准是原到期日，不是申请日；增加的是七个日历日。\"\n+      },\n+      {\n+        \"id\": \"completion-check\",\n+        \"correctIndex\": 1,\n+        \"reference\": \"只能确认申请提交。完成确认需同时有续借成功文字和更新后的归还日期；结果未确认时保留未知，不补造失败或后台步骤。\"\n+      }\n+    ]\n+  },\n+  \"onlyConfigSemanticChange\": \"theme=neutral\",\n+  \"priorChoicesReused\": true,\n+  \"mattRequired\": false,\n+  \"sitesUsed\": false\n+}"},{"sha":"a2eeb73d06f643d351e5c3ca1d9af641ae884bab","filename":"plans/274-html-learning-artifact/evidence/sources/align274/local/run-independent-r1/semantic-review.json","status":"added","additions":73,"deletions":0,"changes":73,"blob_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/7c23f347c0725bdfa57ee1e0f5e9075a8d90babf/plans%2F274-html-learning-artifact%2Fevidence%2Fsources%2Falign274%2Flocal%2Frun-independent-r1%2Fsemantic-review.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/raw/7c23f347c0725bdfa57ee1e0f5e9075a8d90babf/plans%2F274-html-learning-artifact%2Fevidence%2Fsources%2Falign274%2Flocal%2Frun-independent-r1%2Fsemantic-review.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/contents/plans%2F274-html-learning-artifact%2Fevidence%2Fsources%2Falign274%2Flocal%2Frun-independent-r1%2Fsemantic-review.json?ref=7c23f347c0725bdfa57ee1e0f5e9075a8d90babf","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,73 @@\n+{\n+  \"reviewer\": \"/root/alignment_independent_review\",\n+  \"recordedAt\": \"2026-10-20T06:25:31.696Z\",\n+  \"inputRead\": [\n+    \"artifact.json in full\",\n+    \"content.md in full\",\n+    \"sources/renewal-rules.md in full\"\n+  ],\n+  \"boundaries\": \"Project-authored synthetic rules, not a real library policy or action authorization. Source-supported here means faithful to this self-contained exercise, not external factual policy verification.\",\n+  \"originalSourceHashes\": {\n+    \"content.md\": \"060045ce718168c7f3c2aecd2742518490d5693e3dbdeb28b4ac94ce2885cd50\",\n+    \"sources/renewal-rules.md\": \"2a95c4d9b95f3b184fea30aa3fba9daaf34d11624bd888ed4793a0ea7f96af47\"\n+  },\n+  \"reusedDecisions\": {\n+    \"audience\": \"能够读懂基本日期，但尚未区分规则许可、申请提交与完成确认的学习者。\",\n+    \"task\": \"根据本页自编规则，解释续借是否允许、成功或失败后的日期，以及确认完成所需依据。\",\n+    \"goals\": [\n+      \"用两个必要条件的组合解释规则许可，不把且改为或。\",\n+      \"从原到期日计算成功后的七个日历日，失败时保留原日期。\",\n+      \"区分提交、成功确认与未知结果，并指出确认所需的两项依据。\"\n+    ],\n+    \"theme\": \"neutral\",\n+    \"delivery\": \"local-only\",\n+    \"formalRepeatInterview\": \"Not required; all material decisions explicitly supplied\"\n+  },\n+  \"configSemanticsUnchangedExceptTheme\": true,\n+  \"claims\": [\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"LIB1\",\n+      \"conclusion\": \"Only one book/one renewal is modeled. Parallel account categories are not promoted into workflow.\",\n+      \"judgment\": \"Source states scope and parallel categories. Content preserves one-book/one-attempt scope, explains table as condition combinations, invents no ordering. Unneeded account labels remain in complete downloadable source.\",\n+      \"status\": \"PASS_SEMANTIC_REVIEW\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"LIB2\",\n+      \"conclusion\": \"Not overdue AND no other reservation are both necessary; any failed condition means not permitted. Permission does not confirm success.\",\n+      \"judgment\": \"All four condition rows match conjunction. permission-check correctIndex=1 matches the given reservation counterexample; feedback restores the missing second condition.\",\n+      \"status\": \"PASS_SEMANTIC_REVIEW\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"LIB3\",\n+      \"conclusion\": \"Success extends the original due date by seven calendar days. Failure leaves it unchanged. Unknown result provides no basis to select either outcome.\",\n+      \"judgment\": \"Original due date, weekend/cross-month inclusion and failure condition retained. date-check correctIndex=0. Independent UTC calendar arithmetic verifies both examples below.\",\n+      \"dates\": [\n+        {\n+          \"original\": \"2026-10-20\",\n+          \"successAfterSevenCalendarDays\": \"2026-10-27\",\n+          \"failureUnchanged\": \"2026-10-20\"\n+        },\n+        {\n+          \"original\": \"2026-10-29\",\n+          \"successAfterSevenCalendarDays\": \"2026-11-05\",\n+          \"failureUnchanged\": \"2026-10-29\"\n+        }\n+      ],\n+      \"status\": \"PASS_SEMANTIC_REVIEW\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"LIB4\",\n+      \"conclusion\": \"Submission alone is not completion. Both success text and updated due date are needed; missing confirmation does not prove failure.\",\n+      \"judgment\": \"Two evidence conditions, unknown result and no invented backend/time limit are explicit in source and content. completion-check correctIndex=1 is faithful; feedback does not turn unknown into failure.\",\n+      \"status\": \"PASS_SEMANTIC_REVIEW\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"LearningBoundary\",\n+      \"conclusion\": \"Chinese learning explanations/activities with stable English core names and local source links; no mastery/effect claim.\",\n+      \"judgment\": \"All four term mappings retain concept distinctions; activity outcomes are reference judgments. NOT_MEASURED and synthetic-policy disclaimer retained.\",\n+      \"status\": \"PASS_SEMANTIC_REVIEW\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"actualInteraction\": \"NOT_RUN by this Agent. No click/answer/retry/reset/copy/export/keyboard/focus/touch claim. Bounded browser geometry and initial screenshots only.\",\n+  \"result\": \"PASS_BOUNDED_SEMANTIC_REVIEW\"\n+}"},{"sha":"5ce28e0a42b9f781087df184517daafa2f483602","filename":"plans/274-html-learning-artifact/evidence/sources/align274/local/run-