 sub-agent, synthetic design/consumer reading reviewer. Exact backend model not independently inspected; no separate CLI/model run.\",\n+  \"firstObservedClock\": \"2026-10-20 06:13:15 UTC\",\n+  \"recordedAt\": \"Actual evidence capture clock is recorded in manifest.json\",\n+  \"method\": \"Bounded forward reading of actual candidate SKILL and required references, complete private B2 API text capture, U2 choice and actual diff. This is not a real user/native/model/runtime/Sites test.\",\n+  \"scope\": \"Full production prompt baseline; retain local generator and engineering; existing materials read-only with independent outputs; conditional Matt grilling and confirmed design; optional theme; explicit local delivery; native persistence DEFERRED, never PASS.\",\n+  \"actualActions\": [\"Read actual candidate SKILL and all scenario-required references\", \"Read complete B2 local API capture and exact U2 selection\", \"Read current real Matt grilling SKILL without invoking an interview\", \"Inspect product, canonical, runtime and test diffs\", \"Capture read snapshots, resource hashes, source integrity and diff outside worktree\"],\n+  \"notExecuted\": [\"No questions to real Owner\", \"No native window\", \"No Sites API or external state write\", \"No browser\", \"No new CLI model\", \"No generator/artifact/browser checkers; root owns runtime matrix\", \"No candidate edits or git mutation\"],\n+  \"scenarios\": [\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"S1\",\n+      \"request\": \"已给定材料、读者任务目标、中性视觉，明确只本地交付，现有材料只读\",\n+      \"limits\": \"Request class from parent; no concrete learning-material payload was executed. Decisions are predicted by independent reading.\",\n+      \"skills\": [\"Explicit html-guide-kit:site\", \"No Matt grilling if supplied choices settle all material design questions\", \"No Sites for agreed local mode\"],\n+      \"steps\": [\"Resolve actual locator and read method/AICS/terminology plus selected materials\", \"Reuse supplied Audience/Task/Goals/neutral/local choices and check material sufficiency\", \"Write independent Markdown/config/source working package; select theme=neutral in new independent output\", \"Design source-faithful static structure and only justified interactions\", \"Actually run generator, both Python checkers, semantic and representative operation review; inspect screenshots and repair with fresh evidence paths\", \"Deliver HTML, content sources/provenance/version/hash list, necessary design reasons, recovery instructions and actual checks\"],\n+      \"stopPoints\": [\"Stop dependent scope only for actual material insufficiency or a new material design conflict; do not repeat settled decisions for formality\", \"Never alter existing materials or installed resources\", \"Do not create Site/hosting identity, sync remote source, save or deploy for local mode\"],\n+      \"completion\": \"Agreed local content, operations, necessary checks and recovery evidence satisfied. Report actual path, Sites not published/not applicable, effects NOT_MEASURED. Existing supplied choices can serve as existing agreement when no material change occurs.\",\n+      \"judgment\": \"CONSISTENT_BY_READING\",\n+      \"support\": [\"SKILL Locate/Make and verify/completion\", \"execution-guide Clarification\", \"input-contract theme/paths\", \"sites-handoff Delivery modes\", \"evidence-and-evaluation gates\"]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"S2\",\n+      \"request\": \"材料已可查但读者/发布对象有关键未决，用户未答或关闭窗口\",\n+      \"skills\": [\"Explicit html-guide-kit:site\", \"Actually installed Matt grilling when critical design clarification is required\", \"Actual native structured question capability if supported; otherwise explicit chat pending\"],\n+      \"steps\": [\"Inspect material/environment facts and prior decisions first; facts remain Agent work\", \"Use actual grilling design tree, numbered prerequisite-ready rounds with distinct choices/recommendation/reason\", \"Retain same unresolved pending question after no explicit submission or closure\", \"Continue only independent source/provenance/factual checks\", \"After explicit key answers, summarize design and obtain explicit shared-understanding confirmation; reuse prior confirmations\", \"Then proceed with dependent implementation and agreed delivery acceptance\"],\n+      \"stopPoints\": [\"Default, recommendation, preselection, silence, timeout, unrelated reply, close/disappearance is no answer\", \"Do not decide Audience/publishing object or implement/deploy dependent design\", \"If required Matt is missing, record stage dependency gap; do not claim interview completed\", \"Textual pending proves no native persistence\"],\n+      \"completion\": \"Still pending, not completed. Needs explicit necessary answers and design agreement, then actual chosen-mode acceptance. Native persistence stays DEFERRED, never PASS from reading.\",\n+      \"judgment\": \"CONSISTENT_BY_READING\",\n+      \"support\": [\"SKILL Locate paragraphs 3-4\", \"execution-guide Clarification\", \"SPEC section 3\", \"Current Matt grilling frontier/confirmation instructions\"]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"S3\",\n+      \"request\": \"已确认私有Sites且当前Sites能力缺失\",\n+      \"skills\": [\"Explicit html-guide-kit:site\", \"Actual installed Sites discovery/read before use; missing ability blocks that stage\", \"No Matt grilling solely because agreed Sites tooling is missing\"],\n+      \"steps\": [\"Reuse confirmed private Sites scope without redundant Owner decision\", \"Continue authorized independent material/content/design/local generator and checks\", \"Preserve bounded handoff/source/version/check evidence and explicit capability gap\", \"When ability is restored, read current Sites workflow and execute exact source sync/save/deploy plus identity/version/URL/private-audience readback\"],\n+      \"stopPoints\": [\"Never silently change to local-complete mode\", \"Never fabricate identity, connector/tool, save/deploy or audience\", \"Do not automatically install/download substitute or update existing representative Site\", \"Do not claim agreed Sites production/publication or core mode acceptance complete\"],\n+      \"completion\": \"Not completed until agreed actual Sites main flow is verified, or real subsequent user decision changes mode. Local package remains a handoff artifact.\",\n+      \"judgment\": \"CONSISTENT_BY_READING\",\n+      \"support\": [\"SKILL step 5/completion\", \"sites-handoff opening/Delivery modes/Actual execution\", \"evidence-and-evaluation gate 3\", \"SPEC section 5\"]\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"coverage\": {\n+    \"sixStepLanguageSourcesCriteria\": \"Consistent across SKILL, execution-guide, AICS summary, SPEC, GUIDE, INTENT, ADR and PLAN A01/A08\",\n+    \"generatorEngineering\": \"Retained in SKILL step5, generator/static-checker diff and PLAN A01/A06\",\n+    \"materialsReadOnlyIndependentProducts\": \"Consistent across SKILL Locate, input paths, sites handoff, SPEC 4-5 and GUIDE\",\n+    \"conditionalMattAgreementReuse\": \"Consistent across SKILL Locate, execution Clarification, SPEC3 and PLAN A02/A03\",\n+    \"optionalTheme\": \"Consistent bounded theme contract and actual neutral CSS override; minor color-description mismatch F1\",\n+    \"localNoSilentFallback\": \"Consistent across SKILL completion, sites handoff, SPEC5-6, GUIDE and PLAN A05\",\n+    \"nativeDeferredStrictPending\": \"Consistent across SKILL, execution, evidence, SPEC3/6 and PLAN A07\",\n+    \"historicalAcceptanceReleaseLimits\": \"Preserved across AGENTS, PLAN A08, INTENT, ADR, SPEC, GUIDE and CHANGELOG\"\n+  },\n+  \"findings\": [\n+    {\"id\": \"F1\", \"severity\": \"P3\", \"status\": \"Reported to root; follow-up required\", \"path\": \"plugins/html-guide-kit/skills/site/references/input-contract.md\", \"detail\": \"neutral described as 深蓝灰强调 but actual CSS uses pure greys #595959/#404040. Align description or actual color. No scenario-routing impact.\"},\n+    {\"id\": \"F2\", \"severity\": \"P3\", \"status\": \"Re