losses), even if such Contributor\n+      has been advised of the possibility of such damages.\n+\n+   9. Accepting Warranty or Additional Liability. While redistributing\n+      the Work or Derivative Works thereof, You may choose to offer,\n+      and charge a fee for, acceptance of support, warranty, indemnity,\n+      or other liability obligations and/or rights consistent with this\n+      License. However, in accepting such obligations, You may act only\n+      on Your own behalf and on Your sole responsibility, not on behalf\n+      of any other Contributor, and only if You agree to indemnify,\n+      defend, and hold each Contributor harmless for any liability\n+      incurred by, or claims asserted against, such Contributor by reason\n+      of your accepting any such warranty or additional liability.\n+\n+   END OF TERMS AND CONDITIONS\n+\n+   APPENDIX: How to apply the Apache License to your work.\n+\n+      To apply the Apache License to your work, attach the following\n+      boilerplate notice, with the fields enclosed by brackets \"[]\"\n+      replaced with your own identifying information. (Don't include\n+      the brackets!)  The text should be enclosed in the appropriate\n+      comment syntax for the file format. We also recommend that a\n+      file or class name and description of purpose be included on the\n+      same \"printed page\" as the copyright notice for easier\n+      identification within third-party archives.\n+\n+   Copyright 2026 Anthropic PBC\n+\n+   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the \"License\");\n+   you may not use this file except in compliance with the License.\n+   You may obtain a copy of the License at\n+\n+       http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\n+\n+   Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software\n+   distributed under the License is distributed on an \"AS IS\" BASIS,\n+   WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.\n+   See the License for the specific language governing permissions and\n+   limitations under the License."},{"sha":"4d29ba6bdda373a719519d6a271e242ec78fa992","filename":"plans/274-html-learning-artifact/evidence/sources/align274/theme/neutral-output/sources/renewal-rules.md","status":"added","additions":21,"deletions":0,"changes":21,"blob_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/7c23f347c0725bdfa57ee1e0f5e9075a8d90babf/plans%2F274-html-learning-artifact%2Fevidence%2Fsources%2Falign274%2Ftheme%2Fneutral-output%2Fsources%2Frenewal-rules.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/raw/7c23f347c0725bdfa57ee1e0f5e9075a8d90babf/plans%2F274-html-learning-artifact%2Fevidence%2Fsources%2Falign274%2Ftheme%2Fneutral-output%2Fsources%2Frenewal-rules.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/contents/plans%2F274-html-learning-artifact%2Fevidence%2Fsources%2Falign274%2Ftheme%2Fneutral-output%2Fsources%2Frenewal-rules.md?ref=7c23f347c0725bdfa57ee1e0f5e9075a8d90babf","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@\n+# Synthetic Renewal Rules · 自编续借规则\n+\n+这些规则由本插件为代表性合成验收编写，不是任何真实图书馆政策，不授权或执行真实续借。\n+\n+## LIB1 · Scope\n+\n+本练习只处理一本书的一次续借。账户信息“当前借阅”“预约记录”“借阅历史”为并列分类，不表示办理顺序。\n+\n+## LIB2 · Permission\n+\n+书尚未逾期，且没有其他读者预约时，可以续借；任一条件不满足，就不能按这条规则续借。“可以续借”表示规则允许，成功仍须按 LIB4 确认。\n+\n+## LIB3 · Due Date\n+\n+续借成功后，归还日期在原到期日基础上延后七个日历日；续借失败时，原到期日不变。\n+\n+## LIB4 · Confirmation\n+\n+点击“申请续借”只表示申请提交。页面显示“续借成功”并更新归还日期后，才能确认续借完成。\n+\n+没有成功确认不等于已确认失败。规则未提供完整后台状态机或等待时长，不据此补造审批步骤或超时失败。"},{"sha":"e4f6272bc65bf337fc0bb949405df17f66a674df","filename":"plans/274-html-learning-artifact/evidence/sources/align274/theme/neutral-output/theme.css","status":"added","additions":113,"deletions":0,"changes":113,"blob_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/7c23f347c0725bdfa57ee1e0f5e9075a8d90babf/plans%2F274-html-learning-artifact%2Fevidence%2Fsources%2Falign274%2Ftheme%2Fneutral-output%2Ftheme.css","raw_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/raw/7c23f347c0725bdfa57ee1e0f5e9075a8d90babf/plans%2F274-html-learning-artifact%2Fevidence%2Fsources%2Falign274%2Ftheme%2Fneutral-output%2Ftheme.css","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/contents/plans%2F274-html-learning-artifact%2Fevidence%2Fsources%2Falign274%2Ftheme%2Fneutral-output%2Ftheme.css?ref=7c23f347c0725bdfa57ee1e0f5e9075a8d90babf","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,113 @@\n+:root {\n+  color-scheme: light;\n+  --paper: #faf9f5;\n+  --ink: #252521;\n+  --body: #42423c;\n+  --clay: #b45a3b;\n+  --deep-clay: #93442c;\n+  --wash: #f0ece2;\n+  --line: #d6d1c5;\n+  --serif: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n+  --sans: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n+}\n+* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n+html { scroll-padding-top: 1.5rem; }\n+body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--body); font: 1rem/1.85 var(--sans); }\n+a { color: var(--deep-clay); text-underline-offset: .25em; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n+a:hover { color: #6f301c; }\n+button, input, textarea { font: inherit; }\n+button, summary, input, a { touch-action: manipulation; }\n+button { min-height: 44px; padding: .5rem 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--deep-clay); border-radius: .4rem; background: var(--deep-clay); color: #fff; cursor: pointer; }\n+button:hover { background: #74351f; }\n+button:disabled { opacity: .6; cursor: default; }\n+:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--deep-clay); outline-offset: 4px; }\n+[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n+.paper { max-width: 980px; margin: auto; padding: 1.5rem 3rem 0; }\n+.masthead { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--deep-clay); font-size: .8rem; }\n+.masthead p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }\n+main > section { padding: 2.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }\n+h1, h2, h3, h4, h5 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--ink); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n+h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.7rem); margin: .6rem 0 1.5rem; letter-spacing: -.03em; text-wrap: balance; }\n+h2 { font-size: 1.9rem; margin: 2rem 0 1rem; }\n+h3 { font-size: 1.45rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 .8rem; }\n+h4 { font-size: 1.2rem; }\n+p, ul, ol, dl { margin: 0 0 1rem; }\n+li { margin: .35rem 0; }\n+dt { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 650; }\n+dd { margin: 0 0 1rem; }\n+.eyebrow { color: var(--deep-clay); font-size: .8rem; letter-spacing: .12em; }\n+.scope { padding: 1rem 1.2rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--clay); background: var(--wash); font-size: .9rem; }\n+.reading { max-width: 100%; }\n+.reading > p { max-width: 76ch; }\n+.reading h1 { font-size: 2.25rem; }\n+.reading h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }\n+code { font: .9em/1.65 ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; background: var(--wash); padding: .1em .3em; border-radius: .2rem; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n+pre { max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; padding: 1rem; background: var(--wash); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: .4rem; }\n+pre code { padding: 0; background: transparent; overflow-wrap: normal; white-space: pre; }\n+hr { border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin: 2rem 0; }\n+.table-scroll { max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; margin: 1.5rem 0; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: .4rem; }\n+table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: .9rem; }\n+th, td { text-align: left; vertical-align: top; padding: .8rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n+th { color: var(--ink); background: var(--wash); }\n+tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }\n+.terms { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: .8rem 1.5rem; }\n+.terms > div { padding: .8rem 1rem; background: var(--wash); }\n+.terms dd { margin: .25rem 0 0; }\n+.activity { margin: 1.2rem 0; padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: .6rem; background: #fff; }\n+.activity h3 { margin-top: 0; }\n+.scenario { padding-left: 1rem; border-left: 2px solid var(--clay); }\n+fieldset { padding: 0; margin: 1rem 0; border: 0; min-width: 0; }\n+legend { font-weight: 650; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: .5rem; }\n+.option { display: flex; gap: .7rem; align-items: flex-start; padding: .8rem; margin: .5rem 0; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: .4rem; cursor: pointer; }\n+.option input { margin: .4rem 0 0; flex-shrink: 0; accent-color: var(--deep-clay); }\n+.option:has(input:checked) { border-color: var(--clay); background: var(--wash); }\n+.option span { min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n+[data-feedback]:not(:empty) { background: var(--wash); margin-top: 1rem; padding: 1rem; border-radius: .4rem; }\n+[data-feedback] p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n+details { margin-top: 1rem; padding: .5rem 1rem 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: .4rem; }\n+summary { color: var(--deep-clay); padding: .4rem 0; cursor: pointer; }\n+details[open] > summary { margin-bottom: .5rem; }\n+textarea { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 100%; min-height: 8rem; margin: .6rem 0 1rem; padding: .8rem; border: 1px solid #767676; border-radius: .4rem; resize: vertical; background: #fff; color: var(--ink); }\n+.enhancement { display: none; }\n+.js button.enhancement, .js .enhancement { display: block; }\n+.js .practice-controls, .js .export-controls { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .8rem; }\n+.practice-controls p { margin: 0; }\n+.export-box { margin-top: 1rem; }\n+#export-text { font: .85rem/1.7 ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; }\n+#export-status { min-height: 1.8em; }\n+.sources li { margin: 1rem 0; padding-left: .4rem; }\n+.sources p { margin: .2rem 0; }\n+footer { padding: 1.7rem 0; font-size: .8rem; }\n+.skip-link { position: absolute; left: 1rem; top: 1rem; transform: translateY(-250%); background: #fff; padding: .7rem 1rem; z-index: 5; }\n+.skip-link:focus { transform: none; }\n+@media (max-width: 640px) {\n+  .paper { padding: 1.2rem 1.2rem 0; }\n+  main > section { padding: 1.7rem 0; }\n+  h2 { font-size: 1.65rem; }\n+  .terms { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n+  .activity { padding: 1rem; }\n+  th, td { padding: .6rem .7rem; }\n+}\n+@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { *, *::before, *::after { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; } }\n+@media print {\n+  body { background: #fff; color: #000; }\n+  .paper { max-width: none; padding: 0; }\n+  .skip-link, button, .export-controls, .export-box, .practice-controls { display: none !important; }\n+  .table-scroll, pre { overflow: visible; }\n+  .activity { break-inside: avoid; }\n+  a { color: inherit; }\n+}\n+\n+/* Built-in neutral theme */\n+:root {\n+  --paper: #fafafa;\n+  --ink: #222222;\n+  --body: #3d3d3d;\n+  --clay: #595959;\n+  --deep-clay: #404040;\n+  --wash: #f0f0f0;\n+  --line: #767676;\n+  --serif: var(--sans);\n+}\n+a:hover { color: #262626; }\n+button:hover { background: #262626; }"},{"sha":"984eb60f4ec7b557ed91ec5238d6be3afce1e123","filename":"plans/274-html-learning-artifact/evidence/sources/align274/theme/neutral-screenshots/viewport-1366x900.png","status":"added","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changes":0,"blob_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/7c23f347c0725bdfa57ee1e0f5e9075a8d90babf/plans%2F274-html-learning-artifact%2Fevidence%2Fsources%2Falign274%2Ftheme%2Fneutral-screenshots%2Fviewport-1366x900.png","raw_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/raw/7c23f347c0725bdfa57ee1e0f5e9075a8d90babf/plans%2F274-html-learning-artifact%2Fevidence%2Fsources%2Falign274%2Ftheme%2Fneutral-screenshots%2Fviewport-1366x900.png","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/contents/plans%2F274-html-learning-artifact%2Fevidence%2Fsources%2Falign274%2Ftheme%2Fneutral-screenshots%2Fviewport-1366x900.png?ref=7c23f347c0725bdfa57ee1e0f5e9075a8d90babf"},{"sha":"4964aa42772225b13473825feae85ae52ee1f192","